{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;There is no God anymore \u2013</i> <br><i>Satan sits upon His throne.</i> <br><i>But hope for salvation is not yet lost,</i> <br><i>as long as one warrior of God still breathes.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___2_.gif?t=1752219602\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the last priest, descending into the deepest depths to destroy the very essence of evil. Your path is filled with traps, lava, and fear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___7_.gif?t=1752219602\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing fast and aggressive or slow and steady\u00a0<i>\u2013</i> entirely up to you. Master your platforming skills while investigating the lore of the devil's adobe and collecting infernal relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___3_.gif?t=1752219602\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILLS UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Bless Points to upgrade movement skills.\u00a0Bless Points are awarded for completing levels and collecting full relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif__8_.gif?t=1752219602\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEADERBOARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with your friends and other players to see who can complete levels the fastest.\u00a0<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/steampage_leaderboard_1-2.png?t=1752219602\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 levels <i>\u2013</i> from mushroom caves to brutalist megastructures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.5 hours for a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">horror-infused religious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deconstructivist, brutalist, and infernal architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">retro visuals with a modern flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique soundtrack <i>\u2013</i> a fusion of church choirs, ritual percussion, and industrial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> devil\u2019s suspenseful monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">movement skill upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">leaderboard\u00a0<i>\u2013</i> compete with other players in level completion speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">collecting infernal relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sliding on colossal roots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">riding giant snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gateway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2379230/e260ed72d54980fca84eaa7acf6b5a2bd0233878.jpg"},{"name":"Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2379230/e260ed72d54980fca84eaa7acf6b5a2bd0233878.jpg"},{"name":"Towers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2379230/e260ed72d54980fca84eaa7acf6b5a2bd0233878.jpg"},{"name":"Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2379230/e260ed72d54980fca84eaa7acf6b5a2bd0233878.jpg"},{"name":"Roots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub